00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:01.910 align:start position:0%
 
a while back when i used to be  interested in origami one of the things  i used to make a lot would be a paper  balloon  it's pretty cool you can blow it up and  uh you know it doesn't float around or  anything but  it's pretty neat to make so that's what  i'm going to show you how to do today  i also used to make ninja stars  and i used to make a series of them and  just connect them in this  one giant frisbee like thing  and that was also pretty cool so i might  teach you guys how to do that let me  know what you think of this tutorial  and i'll see about making that tutorial  also so today i'm going to teach you how  to make a paper balloon  and what you need is a piece of printer  paper  and a scissor the scissor however is  optional  if you want to do things without  scissors and you just you know want to  make the folds yourself you could do  that also you don't need the scissor  so the first thing you want to do is to  get a piece of printer paper and you're  going to make  one fold across like that  so you want to bring the corner of this  paper all the way  until it meets the left edge of the of  the paper  and you want to fold it so that this is  flat you want this to be perfectly lined  up you don't want to be hanging over  like that  so we're going to fold it  all right so that's pretty lined up now  what you want to do is you want to cut  off this excess that you have here  if you did want to fold it and rip it  off that would be fine  but i'm going to cut it just for  simplification in the tutorial  so you want to cut off this little extra  ledge here  all right so you can throw that away and  what you have here now  if you open it you'll see it's a square  and it should measure eight inches by  eight inches  and as you'll see it already has that  one fold in it now  so now that it has that one fold in it  you want to take  so you can hold this fold going like  that and you want to take the corner of  this page and you want to make another  fold  that's perpendicular to this one so you  want to take this and you want to fold  it all the way  until it meets the edge  and then you want to make a crease like  that also  okay so now if you open it you should  have a square that has an  x in it now what you want to do  is you want to hold the x in front of  you and you want to take this paper  and you want to fold it in half just  like that  until this piece meets the other piece  the edge meets the edge  and now you want to make a crease like  that also  so just crease it and now you'll see if  you open it you should have an x  and a line going through the middle  okay so what you want to do now that you  have the x and the horizontal line is to  fold the paper in half  and you want to just make sure that that  crease is pretty good  lay the paper flat and what you want to  do now is you want to lift  this first layer up and you want to tuck  this corner in  so this corner is right here you want to  tuck it down  here all the way near my thumb  i want to tuck it in like that and then  you want to fold this flap  down and you want to make a crease in  the middle here on that new fold so then  we do the same thing with the other side  lift this first layer up and you  tuck this corner in  and then you just make a crease here  alright so just make the make sure the  whole thing is pretty flat  okay so what you should have now is you  should have something that looks like  this  uh just has these flaps here so you hold  it here so it looks like a triangle  an isosceles triangle and then you take  one flap here and you fold it up  so that the tip of this meets the top of  the triangle  and then you make a crease  do the same thing with the other side  and then flip the paper over and you do  the same exact thing  so you fold this up  fold this one up  and now you'll see you have a diamond  and each of these flaps should be folded  up just like that  now what you want to do is you want to  take remember there's two different  layers here  so you want to take the first layer and  you want to take these ends here  you want to take these ends and you want  to fold this piece  into the middle on this line  you want to fold it right like that  so you fold it like that  do the same thing for the other ones  flip it over  you don't have to be too need about it  doesn't really matter alright so you  should have something that looks like  this  and you should have two free flaps or  wings on the front and two free on the  back  so what you want to do now is you want  to tuck each of these wings  into these little pockets that are here  okay so to do that you take a flap  and you fold it straight down so that  the tip of this  is meeting the tip of this one  and you want to fold it straight down  just like that  then what you do is you fold it over  and then you could tuck it into that  pocket  so you just open it like that and you  tuck  the tip of that into the pocket and you  push it all the way in  and then you fold it down and then you  want to do that for the other three  so  and the last one fold it over  open the pocket tuck it in  and there you go you have a paper  balloon  all right so the balloons ready to be  inflated all you have to do is to flip  it over  and then if you open it by folding it  like that  what you'll see is that there is an  opening here  so what you have to do is just blow on  it and the bloom will be inflated  and it just takes one breath which is  the good thing about it and there you go  you have a paper balloon  so hope you guys enjoy the tutorial and  thanks for watching

